# Allowed Routes (Do Not Create Others Without Approval)

## Seven Top-Level Sections

| # | Nav Label (ID / EN) | Route | Content Source |
|---|---------------------|-------|----------------|
| 1 | Beranda / Home | `/{locale}` | Sanity (latest 3 articles) + hardcoded teasers |
| 2 | Wisata / Attractions | `/{locale}/attractions` | `data/attractions.ts` |
| 2a | Attraction Detail | `/{locale}/attractions/[slug]` | `data/attractions.ts` |
| 3 | Homestay / Homestay | `/{locale}/homestay` | `data/homestays.ts` |
| 4 | Artikel / Articles | `/{locale}/articles` | Sanity (listing) |
| 4a | Article Detail | `/{locale}/articles/[slug]` | Sanity (Portable Text) |
| 5 | Buklet Flora & Fauna | `/{locale}/booklet` | `data/booklet.ts` |
| 6 | Galeri & Unduhan | `/{locale}/downloads` | `data/downloads.ts` |
| 7 | Tentang / About | `/{locale}/about` | Hardcoded + messages JSON |

## Additional Required Pages

- `/{locale}/404` - Bilingual 404 page
- `/sitemap.xml` - Auto-generated sitemap
- `/robots.txt` - Robots file

## App Router Structure

```
app/
├── [locale]/
│   ├── page.tsx                    # Home
│   ├── layout.tsx                  # Root layout with nav/footer
│   ├── not-found.tsx               # 404 page
│   ├── attractions/
│   │   ├── page.tsx                # Attractions listing
│   │   └── [slug]/
│   │       └── page.tsx            # Attraction detail
│   ├── homestay/
│   │   └── page.tsx                # Homestay listing
│   ├── articles/
│   │   ├── page.tsx                # Articles listing
│   │   └── [slug]/
│   │       └── page.tsx            # Article detail (Portable Text)
│   ├── booklet/
│   │   └── page.tsx                # Flora & fauna flip-book
│   ├── downloads/
│   │   └── page.tsx                # Gallery & downloads
│   └── about/
│       └── page.tsx                # About & contact
├── sitemap.ts                       # Sitemap generator
└── robots.ts                        # Robots.txt generator
```

## URL Path Conventions

- URL path segments stay in **English** for simplicity and consistency
- Navigation labels are translated per locale
- Article slugs come from `title_id` (Indonesian), same slug for both locales

## FORBIDDEN

- ❌ Do not create routes not listed above without human approval
- ❌ Do not create API routes for content (use SSG/ISR)
- ❌ Do not create admin/dashboard routes (use Sanity Studio)
- ❌ Do not create user authentication routes
